{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39752","headline":"翁文尧员外拥册礼之归一路有诗名昼锦集先将寄示因书五十六字 · 黄滔","name":"翁文尧员外拥册礼之归一路有诗名昼锦集先将寄示因书五十六字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六窠只佩诸侯印，争比从天拥册归。\n一轴郢人歌处雪，两重朱氏着来衣。\n闽山秀已锺君尽，洛水波应溅我稀。\n明日陪尘迎驷马，定淮斋沐看光辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39752.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39752","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}